11
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:16,700
Another major challenge was met in this century by Enrico Fermi.

12
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:22,700
Born in Italy, he assembled in America the human resources to solve a fundamental problem.

13
00:01:22,700 --> 00:01:29,140
conversion of matter into useful energy through nuclear fission. The result?

14
00:01:29,140 --> 00:01:37,620
Nuclear energy now being used in many ways to serve mankind.

15
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:42,980
Nuclear energy that can help us meet one of the greatest challenges mankind has

16
