Many arid regions are located along the sea coast.

45
00:05:51,419 --> 00:05:55,919
The water, unlimited, but salty.

46
00:05:55,919 --> 00:06:04,120
Desalting the sea is one of the most promising techniques of producing water and increasing man's supply of available fresh water.

47
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:09,139
By converting saltwater into fresh water, we could open up many of these rich soils

48
00:06:09,139 --> 00:06:13,480
